  "details": "1.Open VRC\n\n2.See other users' avatars in a specific world \n\n(Bug occurrence : VDP2025 子鬼ヶ島 -Ogrekin Isle-, Chrono Cabin, Blue Nostalgia, Liora ...etc , VRChat Home/  \n\nNot Bug occurrence : A simple Fishing World, Avater Testing Chanmber, あずまや -Azumaya- ...etc)\n\n3.VRChat crashes unexpectedly\n\nThis does not affect SteamVR or Windows OS.\n\n(It appears that only friends' avatars can be loaded.\n\nI checked both quest-compatible and non-quest-compatible avatars, but both caused crashes.\n\nNo issues occurred even when loading a large number of avatars.\n\nIs this occurring in conjunction with a specific world?\n\n)\n\nThings I've tried\n\n・Reinstall EAC\n\n・PC restart\n\n・PC Discharge\n\n・VRC Cache Clear\n\n・Update NVIDIA graphics drivers to the latest version\n\nI am Japanese.\n\nThe above text was translated using a translation tool.",
